{
  "name": "Piano — prepiano",
  "description": "Polyphonic, sample-free piano using prepiano with no preparations. MIDI pitch and velocity drive strings and hammer; dry centered stereo output routes to Master. All ten performance controls are retained. Notes through A5 keep their existing sound. From C6, a brief deterministic contact pulse excites six fitted body resonances instead of added noise. Hammer mass, hardness, strength and velocity shape the contact. The shortened string decay is unchanged.",
